 ],
 "notes": "Caravan hub modal drawn over the world map. Top bar: resource strip (gold 120, supplies 21 / 24, stars 3), zone plaque with prev/next arrow buttons, the zone name and a small ZONE 01 plate hanging below it, and a square settings (gear) button at the top right. Modal: hanging blue banner emblem at the top left overlapping the header band; gold-gradient title over a castle skyline; red-wine square close button at top right. Section tabs: Adventure is SELECTED (bright gold frame with outer glow, cream label, small gold diamond on its bottom edge at x~340); Caravan and Community are unselected (dark slate fill, thin steel/brass frame, grey labels). Six activity cards in a 3x2 grid; column widths differ in the concept (382 / 363 / 380). Each card is a full-bleed illustration inside a brass frame with corner studs and a dark label bar along the bottom; the bar's left icon section rises above the rest of the bar (its top is 7 px higher: bar.y is that raised top, the main bar top edge sits at bar.y + 7). Boss rush is DISABLED: the whole card is desaturated to greyscale (grey frame, grey title/icon/chevron) and carries an 'In development' badge (hammer icon) centred over the art. Footer: three dark secondary buttons (icon left, label) separated by thin vertical brass rules, and a large gold primary BACK TO MAP button (dark brown uniform-caps label, map scroll icon) at the right. Text is width-fitted; the concept numerals are taller than Crimson Pro's at the same width."
}